note: "the name of rex" is the field "name" of rex, like "rex's name".
a person has a name (text).
a dog has a name (text), an age (a number) and an owner (a person).
let ann be a new person with name "Ann".
let rex be a new dog with name "Rex", age 3 and owner ann.
let dogs be a list of rex.
say the name of rex.
say the name of the owner of rex.
say the name of item 1 of dogs.
say the age of rex plus 1.
set the age of rex to 5.
say rex's age.
add 1 to the age of rex.
increase the age of rex by 2.
say the age of rex.
say the length of the name of rex.
say the name of the owner of item 1 of dogs, "owns", the name of rex.
